 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. THENS.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 01  X   PIC 99.
 01  Y   PIC 99.
 01  C   PIC X.
     88  IS-OK  VALUE "Y".
 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
 MAIN-PARA.
     MOVE 1 TO X. MOVE 2 TO Y. MOVE "Y" TO C.
     IF X = 1 THEN DISPLAY "T1 Y" ELSE DISPLAY "T1 N" END-IF.
     IF X = 2 THEN DISPLAY "T2 N" ELSE DISPLAY "T2 Y" END-IF.
     IF X = 1 AND Y = 2 THEN DISPLAY "T3 Y" END-IF.
     IF X = 3 OR 1 THEN DISPLAY "T4 Y" END-IF.
     IF X IS NUMERIC THEN DISPLAY "T5 Y" END-IF.
     IF NOT X = 5 THEN DISPLAY "T6 Y" END-IF.
     IF IS-OK
         THEN
         DISPLAY "T7 Y"
     END-IF.
     IF X = 1 THEN
         IF Y = 2 THEN DISPLAY "T8 Y"
         ELSE DISPLAY "T8 N"
         END-IF
     END-IF.
     IF X = 1 DISPLAY "T9 Y" END-IF.
     IF (X = 1) THEN MOVE 7 TO Y END-IF.
     DISPLAY "TA 07 " Y.
     DISPLAY "TB SCREEN" UPON CONSOLE.
     DISPLAY "TC " X " " Y UPON CONSOLE.
     DISPLAY "TD END".
     STOP RUN.
